SO-101 lightweight study, 2026-09-21

Derived from The Robot Studio's SO-101 design in TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100,
commit eecbe3e0a9ebb23e25ad7b2759b03884c6660903, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100

Local modifications in this STEP distribution:
  Base_SO101.step: two rounded lightening windows in the mounting wings.
  WaveShare_Mounting_Plate_SO101.step: four rounded lightening windows.
The other nine STEP files are byte-identical copies of the upstream files.
Print-oriented STL files are transformed upstream meshes for unchanged parts
and tessellations of the modified STEP geometry for the two modified parts.

This is an independent, untested prototype study for wk-robotics. It is not an
upstream release or an assertion of equivalent strength, stiffness or payload.
